# UI patterns

- App Router pages in `src/app/<route>/page.tsx` export `metadata`
- Put reusable UI in `src/components/`
- Use `next/link` and `next/image`
- `"use client"` only when the file needs state, effects, or browser APIs
- Tailwind tokens: `background`, `foreground`, `muted`, `gold`, `gold-strong`, `panel`, `line`
- Headlines: `font-serif`; body: default sans
